// Home stations (content/base/blocks_stations.ron), for this pack and Voxmar HD alike: a
// drying rack empty, hung and dried, jerky, a compost heap's boards and its three tops, and
// a handful of compost; a cooking pot empty and simmering (full, it shows decor's stew),
// bowls of porridge and stew; and a well's water. Each loaded and each done station looks
// so from every side.
